Middle of Nowhere mudlib distribution

This is the Middle of Nowhere mudlib distribution, based in part upon the
Discworld mudlib distribution (version 20.0).  It is distributed as a
publicly usable mudlib based off the code running at Middle of Nowhere.
There is no warranty for its use and we cannot be held responsible for
anything you do with the code.  This code is required to be used in a free
way.  No commercial use may be made of any of the code contained in this
distribution.

The Middle of Nowhere administration team (lpmud@jamesmith.com):
Luggage, Keldar.
